ht=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Omnious_Cauldron_be8f13.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Omnious%20Cauldron\">Omnious Cauldron</a>, whose locations are listed here. Use <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/All%20Knowing%20Sausages\"><img alt=\"All Knowing Sausages\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/All_Knowing_Sausages_0b1cf8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/All%20Knowing%20Sausages\">All Knowing Sausages</a> to find out which location is currently active.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt does not move and cannot be pushed.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tDo not attack him, doing so will cause Drunkenness. Kill the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spawn%20of%20the%20Schnitzel\"><img alt=\"Spawn of the Schnitzel\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spawn_of_the_Schnitzel_90d4f5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Spawn%20of%20the%20Schnitzel\">Spawn of the Schnitzel</a> and use the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Schnitzel%20Meat%20Grinder\"><img alt=\"Schnitzel Meat Grinder\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Schnitzel_Meat_Grinder_e3f810.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Schnitzel%20Meat%20Grinder\">Schnitzel Meat Grinder</a> on it to hurt it 250 hp. After it reaches black HP bar, you will only deal 1 damage but still get <a href=\"#/quest/orcsoberfest\">Schnitzel Points</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<